mcp-server-audit plugin (AdminHead)

skills/mcp-server-audit/ is adapted from the
"auditing-mcp-servers-for-tool-poisoning" skill in
https://github.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills
(author: mahipal), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The files were modified: Invariant Labs' mcp-scan was replaced with its
successor Snyk Agent Scan (snyk-agent-scan), with its data-upload and token
requirements stated; the proxy mode was dropped; tool pinning moved to a new
offline script (scripts/mcp_audit.py, which replaces the upstream
scripts/agent.py); Claude Code config locations were added; SSRF and auth
probes were limited to owned local test instances; and the text was condensed
and reorganized into SKILL.md and references/.
